# Sioona Product

**Sioona.ai** — “Signals into Revenue”. Overlay conversation intelligence for finance / high-volume chat. Internal engine name **SignalC1** (do not surface in UI).

Sits on top of existing chat tools (Intercom, Zendesk, WhatsApp, etc.). **Not** a chatbot replacement.

**Now:** 2-week Shadow Mode pilot — win = keep-set SignalScore ≥80% on Eval (week window), not labeled P/R and not more Adapt phrase tuning. Phase 1 loop is **largely built / hosted**; do not treat this rule as “build MVP from scratch.” Stack / blockers: `.cursor/docs/PROJECT_STATE.md`. North star: `.cursor/plans/sioona_product_context.md`.

## Phase 1 loop (largely built)

Ingest export → detect → Shadow Mode Insights → SignalScore feedback → Adapt → Eval keep-set go/no-go vs partner baseline.

Prove domain signal detection beats the customer’s current process with enough precision to earn trust.

**Adapt** = merge partner SignalScore into store taxonomy **overrides** used by `detect.ts` — not taxonomy expansion, not more phrase packs unless Eval proves a gap. Detect v2 (heuristics + optional Groq miss-pass) is **closed** — do not reopen Detect / phrase-tuning. Still not QLoRA / vLLM / LangGraph.

## In play (shipped for pilot)

- Chat ingest (Sioona CSV/JSON, Intercom JSON export, WhatsApp Business `.txt`)
- Core signals: `lead`, `retention`, `upsell` (primary Detect wedge: **retention**)
- Scoring, summaries, suggested actions (**display-only**)
- Insights dashboard + Shadow Mode review queue
- SignalScore feedback; Adapt overrides; partner baseline + lift
- Conversation `groundTruth` + Eval (keep-set ≥80% go)

## Out of scope unless explicitly asked

- Autonomous actions / Action Mode outbound, computer-use, agent swarm
- Auth0 / pgvector / vLLM / LangGraph / QLoRA scaffolds
- Live Intercom/WhatsApp webhooks
- Outcome-based billing, on-prem, chatbot replacement
- Taxonomy expansion / more Adapt phrase tuning to chase recall
- Navy+cyan or Slash/gold branding (UI SoT is Geist rule)

